================================================================================
COMBINED WORK — uefn-verse-mcp
================================================================================

This repository is a fork that combines:

  (A) UEFN Toolbelt lineage — in-editor `uefn_tools` registry, tools, and related
      architecture — originally licensed by Ocean Bennett under GNU AGPL v3.0 with
      an additional visible-attribution term (see section 1 below).

  (B) External MCP host + in-editor HTTP bridge patterns and code derived from
      KirChuvakov’s MIT-licensed uefn-mcp-server / uefn-verse-server work
      (see section 2 below).

Because AGPL v3.0 is copyleft, this combined distribution as a whole is offered
under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 together with the Toolbelt
additional term in section 1. MIT-licensed portions remain usable under MIT for
those portions in isolation; when redistributed as part of this combined work,
the AGPL + additional term applies to the combination.

You must keep both (i) the Toolbelt copyright and visible credit requirement and
(ii) the MIT copyright and permission notice for KirChuvakov’s upstream files.

